续增加，美元承压，美国为保持美元统治低位通过强制手段迫使日元升值，而日本还是以出口导向型经济为发展模式，这让日本出口面临巨大压力，为了刺激经济，日本不得已让之前流向外贸出口的钱流向股市和楼市，引发房地产泡沫的股市泡沫，随后又主动刺破泡沫，导致日本失去了30年。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "15237-15333", "createTime": 1767394131, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "284700689_85RXOHNZR", "userVid": 284700689, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "author": {"userVid": 284700689, "name": "陈雷铭", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/iahdQicCC5VBQY3ImgLdc24t5THVPy9aKQyzPdNCuMY4BMSqLc0k3g0w/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}}, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "2128734_85KBE85x4", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "再看一遍 lin 的日本失落三十年。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "15237-15333", "abstract": "在这一过程初期，日本并没有放弃出口导向型经济增长方式，导致80年代上半期的贸易顺差有更大幅度的增加，结果是1985年签订《广场协议》和紧随其后的汇率失控、经济泡沫和90年代日本“失去的十年”。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "chapterName": "02 繁荣的起点 工业化转型期的投资全景", "chapterIdx": 7, "reviewId": "2128734_85KBE85x4", "userVid": 2128734, "topics": [], "createTime": 1766976218, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "